WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.466 --> 00:00:04.766
Anistar City!

2
00:00:04.833 --> 00:00:08.366
Where Ash will have a chance to earn his seventh Kalos Gym Badge.

3
00:00:08.433 --> 00:00:10.766
And the battle is about to begin!

4
00:00:12.466 --> 00:00:17.633
Keep an eye on the past as you decide who you will be in the future.

5
00:00:17.700 --> 00:00:20.600
- Remember this as we battle.
- Right!

6
00:00:20.666 --> 00:00:23.033
My path is to get that seventh Gym Badge for sure!

7
00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:26.866
- Pika!
- Ha! Then let us begin!

8
00:00:26.933 --> 00:00:28.866
You will be battling these Meowstic!

9
00:00:28.933 --> 00:00:30.466
- Meow.
- Meowstic.

10
00:00:30.533 --> 00:00:32.333
So it's a Double Battle.

11
00:00:32.400 --> 00:00:35.033
Ash will be battling Olympia's strongest duo!

12
00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.933
All right. I'm ready!

13
00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:39.800
♪ You're just a kid on a quest ♪

14
00:00:39.866 --> 00:00:41.566
♪ To be the best of the best ♪

15
00:00:41.633 --> 00:00:45.000
♪ Someday you're destined for power and glory ♪

16
00:00:45.066 --> 00:00:46.466
♪ You know you're up to the test ♪

17
00:00:46.533 --> 00:00:50.300
♪ There's only one way to tell this story ♪

18
00:00:50.366 --> 00:00:53.566
♪ Be a hero! Be a hero! ♪

19
00:00:53.633 --> 00:00:57.000
♪ All the power is at your command ♪

20
00:00:57.066 --> 00:01:01.033
♪ Face your fears and show you're a hero ♪

21
00:01:01.100 --> 00:01:05.733
♪ The future of the world is in your hand! ♪

22
00:01:05.800 --> 00:01:08.000
♪ Pokémon! ♪

23
00:01:10.900 --> 00:01:13.400
All Eyes on the Future!

24
00:01:19.333 --> 00:01:21.400
What do we do with this?

25
00:01:21.466 --> 00:01:26.033
Olympia said she would get a replacement, but I don't know...

26
00:01:26.100 --> 00:01:29.066
Hi! We're here to shoot some video for a story!

27
00:01:29.133 --> 00:01:30.200
Huh?

28
00:01:30.266 --> 00:01:33.466
You're members of Professor Sycamore's staff, correct?

29
00:01:33.533 --> 00:01:34.433
Yes...

30
00:01:34.500 --> 00:01:39.333
We heard about this amazing sundial, so we wanna do a piece on it.

31
00:01:39.400 --> 00:01:41.500
We'd love a comment from you, please?

32
00:01:41.566 --> 00:01:43.300
Look straight into the camera.

33
00:01:43.366 --> 00:01:44.333
Mm.

34
00:01:44.400 --> 00:01:48.233
Well, recent research has shown that the energy given off by this sundial

35
00:01:48.300 --> 00:01:53.200
is the same as the energy that Pokémon release during Mega Evolution.

36
00:01:53.266 --> 00:01:56.833
The same? No way!

37
00:02:01.366 --> 00:02:02.433
All right!

38
00:02:02.500 --> 00:02:05.233
The Anistar Gym Battle between Ash, the challenger

39
00:02:05.300 --> 00:02:08.966
and Olympia, the Anistar Gym Leader, is about to begin!

40
00:02:09.033 --> 00:02:10.800
This is a Double Battle.

41
00:02:10.866 --> 00:02:13.533
Each trainer will battle with two Pokémon at once,

42
00:02:13.600 --> 00:02:16.100
and there will be no substitutions.

43
00:02:16.166 --> 00:02:18.566
- No substitutions, huh?
- Pika.

44
00:02:18.633 --> 00:02:20.100
I'm so nervous!

45
00:02:20.166 --> 00:02:22.200
Both her Pokémon are Psychic types.

46
00:02:22.266 --> 00:02:24.400
So I wonder what kind of battle she's planning.

47
00:02:24.466 --> 00:02:27.666
I'm sure she'd be a tough opponent for any challenger.

48
00:02:27.733 --> 00:02:30.900
- Right.
- Ash can handle it, no doubt!

49
00:02:30.966 --> 00:02:32.633
He always has.

50
00:02:32.700 --> 00:02:35.100
He's constantly looking ahead.

51
00:02:35.166 --> 00:02:38.166
- Ash will find a way!
- Yes, of course he will!

52
00:02:38.233 --> 00:02:40.400
Good luck! You'll be great!

53
00:02:41.633 --> 00:02:44.300
And your Pokémon, if you please.

54
00:02:44.366 --> 00:02:47.933
Right. 'Kay. I choose you!

55
00:02:49.800 --> 00:02:50.966
Froga!

56
00:02:51.033 --> 00:02:54.033
And your other Pokémon?

57
00:02:54.100 --> 00:02:55.733
Pika, pika!

58
00:02:55.800 --> 00:02:57.666
- Hold on, Pikachu.
- Pi?

59
00:02:57.733 --> 00:03:00.233
- I want you to cheer us on.
- Pikachu.

60
00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:03.400
Talonflame, I choose you!

61
00:03:04.600 --> 00:03:08.300
Talonflame!

62
00:03:10.900 --> 00:03:14.400
- Talonflame's his second!
- Give it your best, 'kay?

63
00:03:14.466 --> 00:03:16.400
- Frog.
- Flame.

64
00:03:16.466 --> 00:03:17.533
Pika, pika!

65
00:03:17.600 --> 00:03:21.100
Good! Now, battle begin!

66
00:03:24.266 --> 00:03:28.166
Helping Hand and Future Sight at the same time!

67
00:03:28.233 --> 00:03:32.200
Meow! Meow!

68
00:03:32.266 --> 00:03:34.300
- Meow!
- Meow!

69
00:03:37.000 --> 00:03:39.433
Ah. There it is. Future Sight!

70
00:03:39.500 --> 00:03:42.900
It won't matter. I'll finish this before Future Sight lands!

71
00:03:42.966 --> 00:03:46.000
- Frogadier, Aerial Ace!
- Froga!

72
00:03:46.066 --> 00:03:48.966
Talonflame, Flame Charge, let's go!

73
00:03:49.033 --> 00:03:51.100
Froga!

74
00:03:51.166 --> 00:03:55.566
- Talonflame!
- Frogadier!

75
00:03:56.633 --> 00:03:58.066
Meow!

76
00:03:58.133 --> 00:04:01.266
- Ga! Ga! Dier!
- Meow! Meow!

77
00:04:01.333 --> 00:04:02.666
- Ah!
- Huh?

78
00:04:06.333 --> 00:04:08.333
Pika, pika! Pika, pika! Pika!

79
00:04:08.400 --> 00:04:10.700
- Nah. We'll be fine!
- Pika?

80
00:04:10.766 --> 00:04:12.700
So, what will you do?

81
00:04:12.766 --> 00:04:17.366
All right, you two, I want you to keep a close eye on how the Meowstic move!

82
00:04:24.000 --> 00:04:26.133
Talonflame, use Flame Charge on the male!

83
00:04:26.200 --> 00:04:28.300
Frogadier, use Water Pulse on the female!

84
00:04:30.300 --> 00:04:34.300
Talonflame!

85
00:04:34.366 --> 00:04:38.200
Frogadier!

86
00:04:38.266 --> 00:04:41.466
All right, Light Screen. Then, Dark Pulse!

87
00:04:41.533 --> 00:04:44.300
- Meowstic!
- Flame!

88
00:04:44.366 --> 00:04:47.100
Meow!

89
00:04:47.166 --> 00:04:51.033
That's marvellous! Any damage will be reduced by Light Screen!

90
00:04:51.166 --> 00:04:52.533
Talon? Talonflame!

91
00:04:56.933 --> 00:05:01.266
- Frogadier, catch Talonflame!
- Froga, ga!

92
00:05:02.333 --> 00:05:03.900
Dier!

93
00:05:10.566 --> 00:05:13.066
- Pikachu!
- Flame.

94
00:05:14.466 --> 00:05:18.466
- They defended it.
- Of course they did.

95
00:05:18.533 --> 00:05:21.500
The male's Ability is Prankster.

96
00:05:21.566 --> 00:05:24.466
- I see. That's why.
- What does that mean?

97
00:05:24.533 --> 00:05:27.533
The male can use a support move, like Light Screen,

98
00:05:27.600 --> 00:05:30.266
before its opponent attacks.

99
00:05:30.333 --> 00:05:32.833
That means it can protect the female Meowstic

100
00:05:32.900 --> 00:05:35.700
before Ash can even make his move!

101
00:05:35.766 --> 00:05:38.633
Prankster aids Helping Hand to boost the female's attack.

102
00:05:38.700 --> 00:05:40.633
Opponents can't even get a move in!

103
00:05:40.700 --> 00:05:44.066
Those Meowstic are way too strong!

104
00:05:45.866 --> 00:05:46.900
Oh, Ash.

105
00:05:46.966 --> 00:05:50.000
Well, well. Something wrong?

106
00:05:50.066 --> 00:05:51.933
Where's that spirit you showed before?

107
00:05:52.000 --> 00:05:54.333
All right, both of you, use Psyshock!

108
00:05:55.000 --> 00:05:56.900
Meowstic!

109
00:05:57.866 --> 00:05:59.266
Dodge it, quick!

110
00:05:59.333 --> 00:06:00.500
- Ga!
- Talon!

111
00:06:02.466 --> 00:06:04.200
Huh!

112
00:06:05.766 --> 00:06:09.066
Froga, ga, ga, ga, ga, ga, gadier!

113
00:06:09.133 --> 00:06:15.066
Talonflame! Talonflame! Talonflame! Talon!

114
00:06:15.133 --> 00:06:17.366
Uh-oh. What's happening now?

115
00:06:17.433 --> 00:06:18.666
That's a Psychic move?

116
00:06:18.733 --> 00:06:21.633
The female's Ability must be Keen Eye.

117
00:06:21.700 --> 00:06:23.166
Keen Eye?

118
00:06:23.233 --> 00:06:26.766
That Ability makes it extremely difficult for an opponent to dodge.

119
00:06:26.833 --> 00:06:29.333
Frog, dier...

120
00:06:30.400 --> 00:06:32.600
-Frogadier, Talonflame!

121
00:06:32.666 --> 00:06:36.100
- Froga...
- Talonflame...

122
00:06:38.400 --> 00:06:40.533
- Are you OK?
- Froga.

123
00:06:40.600 --> 00:06:41.833
Talon.

124
00:06:41.900 --> 00:06:45.600
Now I get Olympia's strategy. Let's counter-attack!

125
00:06:45.666 --> 00:06:48.200
Talon!

126
00:06:48.266 --> 00:06:49.800
The time is now.

127
00:06:52.366 --> 00:06:54.966
Ga!

128
00:06:55.033 --> 00:06:56.800
- Frog!
- Flame!

129
00:06:58.666 --> 00:07:00.833
Pika.

130
00:07:00.900 --> 00:07:04.100
- There's the Future Sight.
- What timing.

131
00:07:04.166 --> 00:07:05.666
Perfection!

132
00:07:05.733 --> 00:07:07.566
Just when Ash was making his move.

133
00:07:07.633 --> 00:07:10.066
Olympia's timing stopped that!

134
00:07:11.200 --> 00:07:13.766
What do I do?

135
00:07:13.833 --> 00:07:17.800
- Yeah! Pikachu, I wanna try something.
- Pika?

136
00:07:17.866 --> 00:07:21.500
- OK, now. Listen closely.
- Good. Do what you can.

137
00:07:22.466 --> 00:07:24.433
This will be your test!

138
00:07:24.500 --> 00:07:26.300
Pika.

139
00:07:26.366 --> 00:07:30.166
I'm all ready. I'll pass your test!

140
00:07:30.233 --> 00:07:32.233
- Talon.
- Frog.

141
00:07:34.300 --> 00:07:36.766
OK. We're gonna combine some moves now.

142
00:07:36.833 --> 00:07:40.566
- Talonflame, Brave Bird!
- Talon...

143
00:07:40.633 --> 00:07:42.200
Frogadier, Double Team, go!

144
00:07:42.333 --> 00:07:44.633
Frog! Frog! Frog!

145
00:07:44.700 --> 00:07:46.633
Frog! Frog! Frog! Frog! Frog! Frog!

146
00:07:46.700 --> 00:07:48.833
There must be a million Frogadier!

147
00:07:48.900 --> 00:07:51.133
And that's a great move to hide the real one.

148
00:07:51.200 --> 00:07:55.300
It won't work. Quick, Meowstic! Helping Hand and Dark Pulse!

149
00:07:58.000 --> 00:08:00.766
Meowstic!

150
00:08:04.700 --> 00:08:07.533
Now! All right, Frogadier, use Cut!

151
00:08:07.600 --> 00:08:09.233
Frog...

152
00:08:09.300 --> 00:08:12.233
- Ga!
- Meowstic!

153
00:08:14.933 --> 00:08:16.800
- Ah.
- Let's go!

154
00:08:16.866 --> 00:08:19.433
Flame!

155
00:08:20.700 --> 00:08:22.400
Thunder Wave!

156
00:08:22.466 --> 00:08:25.133
Meow, meow, meow, meow, Meowstic!

157
00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.566
Talonflame!

158
00:08:27.633 --> 00:08:29.133
Frog-ga-ga-ga-ga-ga!

159
00:08:29.200 --> 00:08:30.500
Pika!

160
00:08:30.566 --> 00:08:32.266
-Frogadier!

161
00:08:37.066 --> 00:08:39.233
Who's that Pokémon?

162
00:08:44.066 --> 00:08:46.066
It's Sigilyph!

163
00:08:47.333 --> 00:08:49.166
Sigilyph!

164
00:08:50.833 --> 00:08:54.000
- Frogadier!
- Pikachu.

165
00:08:54.066 --> 00:08:56.933
Talon! Flame...

166
00:08:57.500 --> 00:09:00.533
Use Helping Hand and Future Sight!

167
00:09:00.600 --> 00:09:05.133
Meow, meow! Meow!

168
00:09:05.200 --> 00:09:07.100
Meow, meow!

169
00:09:07.166 --> 00:09:09.966
- Here it comes.
- Pikachu! Pi.

170
00:09:12.733 --> 00:09:15.600
Pi, pi, pi...

171
00:09:15.666 --> 00:09:18.900
Well, whatever they're up to is a mystery to me.

172
00:09:18.966 --> 00:09:22.400
- Pikachu?
- What's Pikachu doing?

173
00:09:22.466 --> 00:09:24.833
- Talonflame.
- Pi, pi, pi...

174
00:09:24.900 --> 00:09:25.933
Huh? Grrrr.

175
00:09:26.000 --> 00:09:29.266
Now let's just see ~how you respond to this.

176
00:09:29.333 --> 00:09:31.533
- Use Psyshock!
- Pi, pi, pi...

177
00:09:31.600 --> 00:09:33.633
Meow!

178
00:09:35.066 --> 00:09:37.400
Get in there, Talonflame, and use Steel Wing!

179
00:09:37.466 --> 00:09:41.466
Talon, talon!

180
00:09:41.533 --> 00:09:44.400
Ah. What's this?

181
00:09:44.466 --> 00:09:48.033
If we can't dodge, we'll attack! Offence is the best defence!

182
00:09:48.100 --> 00:09:53.400
Talon! Talon!

183
00:09:56.733 --> 00:10:00.433
- Water Pulse!
- Froga! Gadier!

184
00:10:01.600 --> 00:10:05.033
- Talonflame!
- Gadier!

185
00:10:05.100 --> 00:10:08.533
- Yes! Way to go, Frogadier!
- Ga...

186
00:10:08.600 --> 00:10:10.900
All right, Talonflame, let 'em have it!

187
00:10:11.033 --> 00:10:14.900
Talonflame!

188
00:10:16.100 --> 00:10:18.900
Meow! Meow!

189
00:10:21.633 --> 00:10:23.700
Talonflame!

190
00:10:23.766 --> 00:10:26.533
- Are you all right?
- Meow.

191
00:10:26.600 --> 00:10:28.033
Yeah, it worked!

192
00:10:28.100 --> 00:10:31.533
Light Screen's not able to defend against physical attacks.

193
00:10:31.600 --> 00:10:33.533
That was a marvellous idea!

194
00:10:33.600 --> 00:10:37.133
Classic Ash battle strategy! Offence is the best defence!

195
00:10:38.800 --> 00:10:42.166
That was awesome, Talonflame! Now don't let up, Frogadier.

196
00:10:42.233 --> 00:10:43.400
Use Aerial Ace!

197
00:10:43.466 --> 00:10:46.533
Froga, ga...

198
00:10:46.600 --> 00:10:49.266
Frogadier...

199
00:10:49.333 --> 00:10:50.600
Oh, no!

200
00:10:50.666 --> 00:10:54.200
- Dark Pulse, go!
- Meowstic!

201
00:10:55.466 --> 00:10:56.533
Ga...

202
00:10:56.600 --> 00:10:58.600
Dier!

203
00:10:58.666 --> 00:11:00.166
Talon!

204
00:11:00.233 --> 00:11:02.833
Talonflame!

205
00:11:03.566 --> 00:11:05.066
Pika!

206
00:11:05.733 --> 00:11:08.633
- Flame!
- Frog!

207
00:11:11.200 --> 00:11:13.166
- Frog...
- Fl... flame...

208
00:11:13.233 --> 00:11:14.966
Frogadier! Talonflame!

209
00:11:16.800 --> 00:11:18.366
Ta... talon...

210
00:11:18.433 --> 00:11:20.133
That was Future Sight.

211
00:11:20.200 --> 00:11:22.866
Heh. There's no way you can stop Future Sight.

212
00:11:26.433 --> 00:11:28.266
- Talonflame.
- Froga.

213
00:11:28.333 --> 00:11:30.300
Hey, are you two all right?

214
00:11:30.366 --> 00:11:31.366
- Talon.
- Frog.

215
00:11:31.433 --> 00:11:33.000
'Kay.

216
00:11:33.066 --> 00:11:36.800
- What do you say, buddy?
- Pikachu. Pika, pika.

217
00:11:36.866 --> 00:11:41.233
Go ahead! Frogadier and Talonflame. Counter-attack!

218
00:11:41.300 --> 00:11:42.866
- Frog!
- Flame!

219
00:11:42.933 --> 00:11:46.433
- Now what? They're up to something.
- They sure are.

220
00:11:46.500 --> 00:11:49.633
- Don't worry about them!
- Yeah! Show them who's boss!

221
00:11:49.700 --> 00:11:50.866
Denne-ne!

222
00:11:50.933 --> 00:11:55.633
- Your spirit is impressive.
- Olympia, we're just getting started!

223
00:11:55.700 --> 00:11:58.633
I'm gonna get that Gym Badge!

224
00:11:58.700 --> 00:12:01.866
In that case, use Helping Hand and Future Sight again!

225
00:12:02.500 --> 00:12:04.100
Meow!

226
00:12:04.166 --> 00:12:06.433
- This is it! Future Sight!
- Pika!

227
00:12:06.500 --> 00:12:08.333
Meow!

228
00:12:09.066 --> 00:12:12.600
- Pi, pi, pi...
- Again!

229
00:12:12.666 --> 00:12:14.900
What in the world are they trying to do out there?

230
00:12:14.966 --> 00:12:17.033
- Let's go!
- Pi, pi, pi...

231
00:12:17.100 --> 00:12:19.233
- Talonflame!
- Dark Pulse and Psyshock!

232
00:12:19.833 --> 00:12:22.233
- Meowstic!
- Meowstic!

233
00:12:22.300 --> 00:12:25.066
- Froga!
- Frogadier, ride on Talonflame!

234
00:12:25.133 --> 00:12:29.500
- Froga! Frogadier!
- Talonflame!

235
00:12:29.566 --> 00:12:31.300
Whoa. That was close.

236
00:12:31.366 --> 00:12:34.533
- Meow!
- Flame!

237
00:12:34.600 --> 00:12:36.233
Dodge, dodge, go!

238
00:12:36.300 --> 00:12:39.766
They intercepted the attack before. What are they doing now?

239
00:12:39.833 --> 00:12:42.333
- Ga, ga, ga!
- The Future Sight's coming soon.

240
00:12:42.400 --> 00:12:44.000
Pi, pi...

241
00:12:44.066 --> 00:12:45.933
Talonflame, flame!

242
00:12:46.000 --> 00:12:48.466
Pi, pi, pi, pi...

243
00:12:48.533 --> 00:12:53.000
- Hah! Now, Talonflame! Nosedive!
- Talonflame!

244
00:12:53.066 --> 00:12:54.466
- Huh?
- Pi, pi, pi...

245
00:12:54.533 --> 00:12:56.333
Flame.

246
00:12:56.400 --> 00:12:59.300
- Do it now!
- Talon!

247
00:13:00.900 --> 00:13:02.466
Meow!

248
00:13:02.533 --> 00:13:05.866
- How clever.
- Now grab hold of the Meowstic!

249
00:13:05.933 --> 00:13:08.166
- Froga!
- Flame!

250
00:13:08.233 --> 00:13:09.833
- Frog!
- Meow!

251
00:13:09.900 --> 00:13:12.900
- Meow!
- Talonflame!

252
00:13:12.966 --> 00:13:16.166
-Talonflame!

253
00:13:16.233 --> 00:13:20.166
Pi, pi, pi...

254
00:13:20.233 --> 00:13:21.733
Pika, pi! Pika, pika!

255
00:13:21.800 --> 00:13:24.333
Right! 'Kay, heads up you two, here it comes!

256
00:13:24.400 --> 00:13:28.166
Talonflame!

257
00:13:28.233 --> 00:13:30.566
Awesome! That Future Sight is ours!

258
00:13:32.400 --> 00:13:34.000
Flame.

259
00:13:40.500 --> 00:13:42.600
- Meow...
- Meowstic! Are you OK?

260
00:13:42.666 --> 00:13:45.000
- Meow.
- All right!

261
00:13:45.066 --> 00:13:49.533
So Ash's plan was to hit the Meowstic with its own Future Sight all along!

262
00:13:49.600 --> 00:13:52.800
Ash and his strategies never cease to amaze me.

263
00:13:53.566 --> 00:13:58.400
Well done. That timing. That's what I was looking for!

264
00:13:58.466 --> 00:14:01.666
- Meow.
- Are you still able to go on?

265
00:14:01.733 --> 00:14:02.866
Meow!

266
00:14:02.933 --> 00:14:06.200
- Now both of you use Psyshock!
- Meow!

267
00:14:06.266 --> 00:14:08.733
- Use Cut!
- Gadier!

268
00:14:08.800 --> 00:14:11.466
- Uh!
- Still paralysed!

269
00:14:12.533 --> 00:14:14.600
Talonflame. Give Frogadier a lift!

270
00:14:14.666 --> 00:14:16.800
Use your speed to help out with that Cut!

271
00:14:18.000 --> 00:14:21.566
- Froga. Dier!
- Talon.

272
00:14:21.633 --> 00:14:23.600
- Talon!
- Meow!

273
00:14:23.666 --> 00:14:26.600
Use Helping Hand and Dark Pulse and close the pincer!

274
00:14:26.666 --> 00:14:29.466
- Meow!
- Meow!

275
00:14:29.533 --> 00:14:31.166
Meowstic!

276
00:14:31.233 --> 00:14:32.300
Use Flame Charge!

277
00:14:32.366 --> 00:14:35.500
- Gadier!
- Talon!

278
00:14:40.300 --> 00:14:41.900
- Ah!
- Go, Ash!

279
00:14:41.966 --> 00:14:46.200
Working together like that, they're more than twice as strong as on their own!

280
00:14:46.266 --> 00:14:47.266
Meow.

281
00:14:47.333 --> 00:14:52.266
Awesome! OK, you two. Now, let's finish this!

282
00:14:52.700 --> 00:14:54.166
- Froga.
- Flame.

283
00:14:55.500 --> 00:14:57.566
- Meow.
- Flame!

284
00:14:57.633 --> 00:14:59.800
- Use Flame Charge!
- Meow!

285
00:14:59.866 --> 00:15:03.766
Flame, flame, flame!

286
00:15:04.400 --> 00:15:07.266
Meow! Meow!

287
00:15:07.333 --> 00:15:08.333
- Meow?
- Froga.

288
00:15:08.400 --> 00:15:10.200
Now, Frogadier, use Water Pulse!

289
00:15:10.333 --> 00:15:13.133
Froga... ga...

290
00:15:13.200 --> 00:15:15.366
Ah! Use Psyshock!

291
00:15:15.433 --> 00:15:17.266
Meow!

292
00:15:17.333 --> 00:15:19.033
Ga! Ga...

293
00:15:19.100 --> 00:15:22.600
Froga! Ga, ga...

294
00:15:22.666 --> 00:15:24.500
Meow!

295
00:15:24.566 --> 00:15:28.000
Ga!

296
00:15:28.066 --> 00:15:30.000
Ga!

297
00:15:33.066 --> 00:15:36.533
- Ga...
- Don't give up!

298
00:15:41.733 --> 00:15:45.666
We're going to the top together, right? You can do it, Frogadier!

299
00:15:45.733 --> 00:15:48.300
You can't give up now!

300
00:15:49.900 --> 00:15:54.133
Ga! Ga!

301
00:15:54.200 --> 00:15:59.866
Gadier!

302
00:15:59.933 --> 00:16:01.900
Do it!

303
00:16:03.600 --> 00:16:05.900
- Meowstic!
- Meow!

304
00:16:06.700 --> 00:16:08.900
Meow!

305
00:16:08.966 --> 00:16:10.766
Meow! Meow...

306
00:16:13.133 --> 00:16:15.600
Both Meowstic are unable to battle!

307
00:16:15.666 --> 00:16:17.900
- Talonflame and Frogadier win!
- Talonflame!

308
00:16:17.966 --> 00:16:20.000
- Thus, the victory goes to Ash.
- Frog.

309
00:16:20.066 --> 00:16:22.233
- The challenger!
- Hm.

310
00:16:22.300 --> 00:16:25.100
- All right!
- Pika!

311
00:16:25.166 --> 00:16:27.033
- They won!
- Yay! Yay!

312
00:16:27.100 --> 00:16:30.100
Denne!

313
00:16:30.166 --> 00:16:32.866
Frogadier! Talonflame!

314
00:16:32.933 --> 00:16:34.666
- You were amazing!
- Pi, pika!

315
00:16:34.733 --> 00:16:35.833
Froga. Ga!

316
00:16:35.900 --> 00:16:38.633
- Frogadier, no! Huh?
- Pika!

317
00:16:39.666 --> 00:16:41.366
Froga.

318
00:16:41.433 --> 00:16:44.233
The two of you together were totally incredible!

319
00:16:45.566 --> 00:16:47.566
- Flame.
- Pikachu.

320
00:16:47.633 --> 00:16:50.866
- Buddy, you were really great too!
- Pika, pika.

321
00:16:50.933 --> 00:16:55.400
You gave it everything you had and battled very bravely.

322
00:16:55.466 --> 00:16:58.366
Now take a good rest.

323
00:16:58.433 --> 00:17:00.566
Thank you so much, Olympia!

324
00:17:00.633 --> 00:17:01.833
Young man.

325
00:17:01.900 --> 00:17:05.233
During our battle, you truly were one with your Pokémon,

326
00:17:05.300 --> 00:17:09.433
and I could sense those strong bonds with all your Pokémon.

327
00:17:09.500 --> 00:17:12.933
That's love. The true power of love!

328
00:17:13.000 --> 00:17:17.099
You battled very well, Frogadier and Talonflame,

329
00:17:17.166 --> 00:17:18.933
and you too, Pikachu!

330
00:17:19.000 --> 00:17:21.200
- Pika, pika.
- Pikachu?

331
00:17:21.266 --> 00:17:25.166
Pikachu was timing exactly when the Future Sight attacks would go off.

332
00:17:25.233 --> 00:17:27.533
- Pikachu.
- Yeah?

333
00:17:27.599 --> 00:17:31.566
- Wow, that's what it was!
- A true victory for teamwork.

334
00:17:31.633 --> 00:17:33.500
So, Olympia, during the battle,

335
00:17:33.566 --> 00:17:36.500
were you able to decipher any of Frogadier's future?

336
00:17:36.566 --> 00:17:37.766
Mm. Yes.

337
00:17:37.833 --> 00:17:40.800
I perceived great love during its final move.

338
00:17:40.866 --> 00:17:45.700
I believe you and Frogadier will achieve even greater heights together.

339
00:17:45.766 --> 00:17:47.000
- Gadier.
- Pika.

340
00:17:47.066 --> 00:17:49.133
One thing about this love!

341
00:17:49.200 --> 00:17:52.266
If the two of you do not go forward with sincere purpose,

342
00:17:52.333 --> 00:17:55.000
then great danger awaits you both!

343
00:17:58.533 --> 00:18:01.066
So, please, do not lose sight of your dream.

344
00:18:01.133 --> 00:18:03.566
- Right!
- Frog.

345
00:18:03.633 --> 00:18:07.266
And now, proof of your victory at the Anistar Gym.

346
00:18:11.666 --> 00:18:13.000
It's the Psychic Badge.

347
00:18:13.066 --> 00:18:14.333
-Pika!

348
00:18:15.633 --> 00:18:19.066
All right! I got the Psychic Badge!

349
00:18:19.133 --> 00:18:21.533
- Pika, pika!
- Cha!

350
00:18:21.600 --> 00:18:25.300
- Congratulations, Ash!
- One more badge until the Kalos League!

351
00:18:25.366 --> 00:18:27.300
You've come such a long way!

352
00:18:27.366 --> 00:18:29.933
You have! Both you and your Pokémon.

353
00:18:30.000 --> 00:18:32.400
Truly marvellous!

354
00:18:32.466 --> 00:18:34.500
I'm impressed!

355
00:18:36.966 --> 00:18:40.400
I've wanted to ask you something all this time.

356
00:18:40.466 --> 00:18:43.033
The danger you were seeing around Kalos.

357
00:18:43.100 --> 00:18:44.833
What exactly was it?

358
00:18:44.900 --> 00:18:47.866
- Green fire.
- Huh?

359
00:18:47.933 --> 00:18:50.133
A flickering green flame.

360
00:18:50.200 --> 00:18:53.766
I saw it engulf Kalos and threaten to consume all of the people

361
00:18:53.833 --> 00:18:57.733
and Pokémon in that swirling fire!

362
00:18:57.800 --> 00:19:02.066
You will all play a substantial role in the chaos and turmoil.

363
00:19:02.133 --> 00:19:05.466
And every one of the villains who tried to steal the sundial.

364
00:19:05.533 --> 00:19:07.166
You mean Team Rocket?

365
00:19:07.233 --> 00:19:10.200
What role you play is up to you.

366
00:19:10.266 --> 00:19:12.233
Be sure to take good care.

367
00:19:12.300 --> 00:19:15.666
The great whirlwind threatens to engulf you all.

368
00:19:18.033 --> 00:19:20.833
- Is this a cold?
- Hm.

369
00:19:20.900 --> 00:19:23.666
Hm. I don't have a fever.

370
00:19:23.733 --> 00:19:26.733
Maybe some yahoo's yappin’ about us.

371
00:19:28.500 --> 00:19:31.033
Professor, thanks for cheering us on!

372
00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.133
Pika!

373
00:19:32.200 --> 00:19:36.266
I should thank you. It was a truly marvellous battle to behold.

374
00:19:36.333 --> 00:19:39.533
And for that, here's the most recently updated Pokédex.

375
00:19:39.600 --> 00:19:41.866
One for Serena, too.

376
00:19:41.933 --> 00:19:44.133
Aah!

377
00:19:44.200 --> 00:19:45.933
Thank you very much!

378
00:19:46.000 --> 00:19:48.766
- I'm jealous!
- Maybe when you're a bit older.

379
00:19:48.833 --> 00:19:49.800
Mm-hm.

380
00:19:49.866 --> 00:19:55.033
Those units also contain all of our current research on Mega Evolution.

381
00:19:55.100 --> 00:19:58.000
I hope it helps you on future adventures!

382
00:19:58.066 --> 00:19:59.266
Thanks!

383
00:19:59.333 --> 00:20:02.933
Have you decided where you'll go for your final Gym Battle?

384
00:20:03.000 --> 00:20:04.766
No. I haven't thought about it.

385
00:20:04.833 --> 00:20:07.033
Let's see where the nearest gym is.

386
00:20:07.100 --> 00:20:10.800
♪ Ta-da! ♪ Here! Snowbelle City.

387
00:20:10.866 --> 00:20:13.633
Great! That's where we'll go!

388
00:20:13.700 --> 00:20:15.100
Pika!

389
00:20:15.166 --> 00:20:18.233
Following a tough battle at the Anistar City Gym,

390
00:20:18.300 --> 00:20:21.733
Ash finally managed to win his seventh Kalos Gym Badge!

391
00:20:21.800 --> 00:20:25.533
Now, what does the future that Olympia predicted hold?

392
00:20:25.600 --> 00:20:27.500
What dangers await?

393
00:20:27.566 --> 00:20:29.466
The answers...

394
00:20:32.033 --> 00:20:34.866
Deep green eyes...

395
00:20:36.366 --> 00:20:39.400
What is this you're trying to tell me?

396
00:20:39.466 --> 00:20:41.133
Aah!

397
00:20:44.600 --> 00:20:46.966
..as the journey continues!
